 "notes": [
  "All registers are holding registers read with function 03; the device lists no write function, so it is read-only over Modbus.",
  "32-bit floats put the least significant word at the listed register (CDAB); the guide states this and labels each pair LSW then MSW.",
  "Unavailable data reads as quiet NaN (float) or 0x8000 (16-bit integer) rather than an exception.",
  "Serial settings are changed with Vaisala Industrial Protocol serial commands (service port), not over Modbus.",
  "Integer moisture and temperature registers carry one decimal (raw x 0.1); integer H2 values are whole ppm.",
  "Registers 11-14 and 262-263 are not used in the published table."
